# The "with optionals" pass: all four mods this port has an optional patch for, together. None
# is mutually incompatible with another, so one combined pass covers all four rather than one
# pass per mod; each scenario that needs one is gated by its own @requires tag regardless.
# Ids read from each mod's own About.xml / Workshop page, 2026-09-28.
#
# Vanilla Expanded Framework is Alpha Biomes' own hard dependency (not this mod's, not staged by
# default). Its omission stalled the first run (98ce, 2026-09-28) on a TypeLoadException from a VEF
# type Alpha Biomes could not resolve, cascading into thousands of "BadTexture" warnings until the
# watchdog gave up. The staging script does not resolve a dependency's dependencies. Listed
# before Alpha Biomes: prerequisites go before their consumers.
#
# ORDER. The staging script places the mod under test after everything the overlay names, which
# breaks this port's declared order (found by 8233, 2026-09-28): it must load AFTER Nocturnal
# Animals (loadAfter) and BEFORE A Dog Said 2 (loadBefore), the same trap as Dalmatians Renew
# pass 3. Naming the mod itself here, between the two, sets the order it declares. Without this
# line the with-optionals pass would test a load order the metadata forbids.
